    "title": "Aluminum Dynamics pulls out of Benson following pushback - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Michael Cooper ,\n9 hours ago TUCSON, Ariz. (13 News) - Aluminum Dynamics has announced that it is pulling out of Benson and will not build its controversial aluminum smelting plant. The company had planned to construct a 200-acre facility, but saw severe pushback from the community and the eventual recall of three council members. More... Read full article\n1",
